# cw148, the patient counter (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 1: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle cw148
revision 1
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent broad light
tier full
written_for tn_cw_myrtle_stillford
written_by claude-codex-cw-2
title the patient counter
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant
traits temper=calm talk=plain warmth=warm humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk swims_in_the_lake_even_in_autumn
likes roast_pork wrestling full_larder frosty_mornings
dislikes waiting rats
fears a_larder_emptied_by_winter a_shape_beneath_the_ice
hopes a_full_shelf_for_every_neighbour fair_wagons_through_the_snow
topics work +0.5 prices +0.4 home +0.3 food +0.3 weather +0.2
styles comfort=warm gossip=reluctant refuse=plain tease=dry
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# keeps the #shelves# stocked, waits patiently for customers but dislikes late #wagons#, and swims in autumn #water#.

words
oath! = Shelf and shore | By the last good loaf
saying! = Count what is left before promising more | A full shelf is a neighbour's comfort
shop = shop | village store
store = store | general store
counter = counter | front counter
shelf = shelf | wooden shelf
shelves = shelves | wooden shelves
larder = larder | full larder
stock = stock | store stock
goods = goods | everyday goods
order = order | written order
orders = orders | written orders
list = list | stock list
ledger = ledger | trade ledger
page = page | ledger page
mark = mark | pencil mark
scale = scale | counter scale
weight = weight | measured weight
measure = measure | full measure
price = price | posted price
prices = prices | posted prices
coin = coin | earned coin
change = change | correct change
customer = customer | waiting customer
customers = customers | neighbours shopping
neighbour = neighbour | local neighbour
stranger = stranger | passing traveller
visitor = visitor | road visitor
seller = seller | wagon seller
hand = hand | store hand
hands = hands | helping hands
